    "note": "Sub. S.B. 360 as Reported by the House State and Local Government Committee (03_RH); no date in file. Later amendments and the final vote are not in the text read. Also amends R.C. 5502.63 to widen the definition of 'federally licensed firearms dealer' (struck 'or their', added destructive devices, firearms and ammunition for them)."
